  "description": "Enterprise‑grade shared HTTP infrastructure library for .NET that simplifies API and microservices consumption, supports high‑performance streaming, OAuth2 / OpenID Connect (IdentityServer), IP geolocation, and SQL Server Reporting Services (SSRS) integration.",
